# Voice Typing

Moonshine ONNX voice dictation for Linux/Wayland.

## Install

    $ nix profile install .

## Usage

Bind `whisper-dictation-toggle` to a key in your Sway config:

    bindsym XF86Favorites exec whisper-dictation-toggle

- First press: loads model, then starts recording
- Second press: stops recording, transcribes, types result
- Subsequent presses: instant toggle (model stays loaded)

## How it works

- `whisper-dictation-daemon`: background process that keeps the model in RAM
- `whisper-dictation-toggle`: starts daemon if needed, toggles recording via signal
- `whisper-dictation-repeat`: re-types the last transcription

The daemon stays running for instant recording on subsequent toggles. It auto-shuts
down after 15 minutes idle.

## Stop daemon manually

    $ pkill -f whisper-dictation-daemon
